            p 저장 에너지는
            p 식[U = \tfrac{1}{2}LI_{\infty}^{2} = \tfrac{1}{2}(0.50)(0.40)^{2} = \tfrac{1}{2}(0.50)(0.16) = 0.040\,\mathrm{J}]식
            p 2자리로 식[\tau = 20\,\mathrm{ms}]식, 식[I_{\infty} = 0.40\,\mathrm{A}]식, 식[i(10\,\mathrm{ms}) = 0.16\,\mathrm{A}]식, 식[U = 0.040\,\mathrm{J}]식.
