            p 식[\frac{1}{15.0}+\frac{1}{q} = \frac{1}{10.0}]식
            p 식[\frac{1}{q} = \frac{1}{10.0}-\frac{1}{15.0} = \frac{3-2}{30.0} = \frac{1}{30.0} \Rightarrow q = +30.0\,\mathrm{cm}]식
